  tasks:
  - taskText: Your friend doesn't have much money and asks you for 100 euros. What
      do you say to them?
    taskImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 920ea28da3ac4124c8324ec124336b33, type: 3}
    recordingTime: 30
  - taskText: You can't come to class/work today. You send a voice message to your
      teacher/boss and tell them why you can't come. What do you say in the message?
    taskImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 70e6137e7839a9249bff9769a855800e, type: 3}
    recordingTime: 30
  - taskText: Describe what you normally do at home.
    taskImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 510f40ab499214748a5484e802bdc006, type: 3}
    recordingTime: 60
  - taskText: "Describe what languages \u200B\u200Byou use and where. What languages
      \u200B\u200Bdo you speak at home, in the shop, at work...? Do you watch TV
      or listen to music in another language?"
    taskImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b40bfb9fe62e3c4ab9c4d4c95194286, type: 3}
    recordingTime: 60
  - taskText: In this task, you can either use the picture above or answer based
      on your shopping habits. What do you normally buy at the store? What don't
      you normally buy from the store? When do you normally go shopping?
    taskImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57369bc2321466341abcb8220a27a33a, type: 3}
    recordingTime: 60
  taskTextGO: {fileID: 1186766482}
  taskImageGO: {fileID: 698106385}
  currentTaskSelected: -1
